    "| L1  | Use the vplat runtime for I/O, never semihosting          | rule     | resolved |\n",
    "| L5  | `lr`/`sc` reservation cannot span the trigger             | hard     | open   |\n",
    "| L4  | Sync M-mode trap OK; no delegation / page faults          | hard     | partial |\n",
    "| L9  | Only UART2 + SimControl work inside the ROI               | hard     | partial |\n",
    "| L8  | One hart only                                             | hard     | open   |\n",
    "| L3  | Paging stays off (`satp` not restored)                    | hard     | open   |\n",
    "| L7  | Static image checked; runtime overflow silent; 2 GiB max  | hard     | partial |\n",
    "| L25 | Do not read/write `mcycle`/`minstret`/`mip`/`time` in ROI | accuracy | by design |\n",
    "| L2  | PMP not carried for M-mode handoffs                       | accuracy | partial |\n",
    "| L21 | Only the cache/misc Andes CSRs are carried                | accuracy | partial |\n",
    "| L14 | SimPoint estimate is approximate                          | accuracy | by design |\n",
    "\n",
    "For the full list and the source-of-truth `L`-ids, see\n",
    "`andes_sim_limitations.ipynb`."
   ]
  }
